%% Sequence Diagram - Doc va danh dau da doc thong bao (ADR-023/024)
%% Notification la NGOAI LE hop le duy nhat cua ADR-006/019: khong project-scoped nen
%% khong di qua IProjectAuthorizationService. Pham vi truy cap bao dam bang CAU TRUC:
%% moi method cua INotificationRepository deu bat buoc nhan employeeId.
sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User as Nguoi dung
participant API as NotificationsController
participant Service as NotificationFeedService
participant CurrentUser as ICurrentUserService
participant Repo as NotificationRepository
participant UoW as UnitOfWork
participant DB as Database

rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
Note over User,DB: 1) Doc danh sach thong bao cua chinh minh
User->>API: GET /api/v1/notifications?isRead=false
API->>Service: GetMineAsync(isRead, pagedRequest)
Service->>CurrentUser: RequireEmployeeId()
alt chua dang nhap
  CurrentUser-->>Service: null
  Service-->>API: UnauthorizedException
  API-->>User: 401 Unauthorized
else da dang nhap
  CurrentUser-->>Service: employeeId (tu JWT)
  Note over Service,Repo: Khong co overload nao nhan employeeId tu client,<br/>nen khong co duong doc thong bao cua nguoi khac (ADR-023)
  Service->>Repo: GetPagedForRecipientAsync(employeeId, isRead, request)
  Repo->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE EmployeeId=@me AND IsRead=@isRead<br/>ORDER BY CreatedAt DESC
  DB-->>Repo: rows
  Repo-->>Service: PagedResult[Notification]
  Note over Service: Mapper suy ra RelatedEntityKind tu Type (ADR-025)<br/>de client biet dieu huong toi Project hay Task
  Service-->>API: PagedResult[NotificationResponse]
  API-->>User: 200 OK
end
end

rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
Note over User,DB: 2) Danh dau MOT thong bao da doc
User->>API: PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read
API->>Service: MarkAsReadAsync(id)
Service->>CurrentUser: RequireEmployeeId()
CurrentUser-->>Service: employeeId
Service->>Repo: GetForRecipientAsync(id, employeeId)
Repo->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE Id=@id AND EmployeeId=@me
DB-->>Repo: row or null
Repo-->>Service: Notification or null
alt khong ton tai HOAC la thong bao cua nguoi khac
  Note over Service: Hai truong hop co y KHONG phan biet duoc:<br/>403 se xac nhan cho nguoi ngoai rang id do ton tai that<br/>(OWASP API1:2023, cung ly do ADR-006 chon 404)
  Service-->>API: NotFoundException(Notification, id)
  API-->>User: 404 Not Found
else la thong bao cua chinh minh
  Service->>Service: notification.MarkAsRead()
  alt da doc tu truoc
    Note over Service: Idempotent (ADR-023): khac ProjectMember.Accept(),<br/>bam chuong hai lan khong phai vi pham nghiep vu.<br/>MarkAsRead() tra false -> khong phat sinh UPDATE vo nghia
    Service-->>API: NotificationResponse (IsRead=true)
    API-->>User: 200 OK
  else lan dau danh dau
    Service->>UoW: SaveChangesAsync()
    UoW->>DB: UPDATE Notifications SET IsRead=1, UpdatedAt=...
    DB-->>UoW: ok
    Service-->>API: NotificationResponse (IsRead=true)
    API-->>User: 200 OK
  end
end
end

rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
Note over User,DB: 3) Danh dau TAT CA da doc (ADR-024)
User->>API: PATCH /api/v1/notifications/read-all
API->>Service: MarkAllAsReadAsync()
Service->>CurrentUser: RequireEmployeeId()
CurrentUser-->>Service: employeeId
Service->>Repo: GetUnreadForRecipientAsync(employeeId)
Note over Repo: CO tracking (khong AsNoTracking):<br/>bat buoc di qua ChangeTracker
Repo->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE EmployeeId=@me AND IsRead=0
DB-->>Repo: rows chua doc
Repo-->>Service: IReadOnlyList[Notification]
alt khong co gi chua doc
  Service-->>API: MarkAllReadResponse(0)
  API-->>User: 200 OK (khong goi SaveChanges)
else co N ban ghi chua doc
  loop moi thong bao chua doc
    Service->>Service: notification.MarkAsRead()
  end
  Note over Service,UoW: ADR-024: KHONG dung ExecuteUpdateAsync.<br/>Bulk update di thang xuong SQL nen bo qua ApplyAuditFields():<br/>IsRead van dung nhung UpdatedAt mat — dung loai loi am tham<br/>ma ADR-008 da tu choi mot lan khi chon Option A
  Service->>UoW: SaveChangesAsync()
  Note over UoW: MOT lan SaveChanges du sua N ban ghi (ADR-007)
  UoW->>DB: UPDATE ... (N dong, kem UpdatedAt)
  DB-->>UoW: ok
  Service-->>API: MarkAllReadResponse(N)
  API-->>User: 200 OK
end
end
